mod backend.types.declarations;

/**
 * THE OBJECTS FOR WHAT A PROGRAM DECLARES
 *
 * The files of this package (module `backend.types.declarations`):
 *
 *      sharp_declaration.sharp  what all declared things share (kind, name, flags, place, owner); the scope of names
 *      sharp_class.sharp        a class, interface or enum; a type parameter; an enum value
 *      sharp_field.sharp        a field or global variable; an alias
 *      sharp_function.sharp     a function, constructor, init block, getter, setter; a parameter
 *      sharp_component.sharp    a component, one `single` / `factory` definition of it, what a `get` / `inject` asks for
 *      local_variable.sharp     a parameter or local variable of a function body (stage 6)
 *      closure_record.sharp     the variables of one function that its lambdas capture (stage 9)
 *      name_table.sharp         a hash table from names to what they mean, faster than hash_map<string, ...> (stage 10)
 *
 * This file is the package's front door: it only says what is where.
 */
